	"hut-placed-guardtower": "{0} placed. Right-click it to order level 1. Settlers with the Guard job move in by themselves. Put weapons and armor in its storage or the warehouse, and guards take the best.",
	"hint-guardtower": "Guards here keep watch at night and sleep by day. They fight the monsters on the Hostiles tab, help settlers who are attacked, and take the best weapons and armor from this storage and the warehouse. Each level adds room for one more guard.",
	"guide-guardtower": "<strong>Guard Tower</strong><br>Guards live and work here: one per level of the tower (one while only the tower block stands).<br><br><strong>Main</strong>: rename the tower, choose who works here (Manage workers), call the guards back (Recall workers), and set how soon couriers come for what is in the tower's storage.<br><strong>Selection tools</strong>: get a Guard Scepter. On the Guard task, right-click a block with it to make that the guards' spot. On the Patrol task, each block you click becomes the next patrol point; taking a new scepter starts the route over.<br><strong>Hostiles</strong>: which creatures the guards fight. Everything is on to start with.<br><strong>Settings</strong>: Guard (stay at one spot), Patrol (walk a route) or Follow (be your bodyguard, even outside the colony), and whether badly hurt guards fall back to the tower.<br><strong>Minimum stock</strong>: hold an item and press Add held item; couriers keep at least that many here.<br><strong>Statistics</strong>: monsters killed and more.<br><br>Guards wear armor (helmet, body, legs) from the tower's storage or the warehouse. It protects them the way it protects you and wears out.",
