	"guide-barracks": "<strong>Barracks</strong><br>A bigger home for guards: two per level (two while only the hut block stands). New guards go to Guard Towers with room first, then to the Barracks.<br><br>The Barracks has the same tabs as a Guard Tower: <strong>Main</strong> (workers, recall, courier pickups), <strong>Selection tools</strong> (the Guard Scepter for the guard spot or patrol route), <strong>Hostiles</strong>, <strong>Settings</strong> (Guard, Patrol or Follow, and falling back when hurt), <strong>Minimum stock</strong> and <strong>Statistics</strong>.<br><br>Its guards fight monsters up to 32 blocks from their guard spot (20 for a tower), and the automatic patrol visits every hut within 96 blocks (48 for a tower).",
