	"hut-placed-explorer": "{0} placed. Give a settler the Explorer job. The explorer walks out and marks what it finds on the map.",
	"hut-placed-gatherer": "{0} placed. Give a settler the Gatherer job. The gatherer picks berries, mushrooms and loose stones near the hut.",
	"hint-explorer": "The explorer walks out up to {0} blocks from the hut and looks around. It marks ore, clay, traders, animals, danger and landmarks on the Colony markers map layer.",
	"hint-gatherer": "The gatherer picks ripe berries and fruit, mushrooms, and loose stones, flints and sticks up to {0} blocks from the hut. It marks the plants it sees on the Colony markers map layer.",
	"guide-explorer": "<strong>Explorer's Hut</strong><br>The explorer goes out and marks what it finds on the map.<br><br><strong>Main</strong>: rename the hut, choose who works here, and order upgrades.<br><strong>Work area</strong>: how far out the explorer goes, and whether a guard goes along.<br><strong>Markers</strong>: what the explorer marks, and a button to remove its markers.<br><br>The explorer visits one spot after another, nearest first, and looks around at each. Markers show on the Colony markers layer of the world map. With More Map Icons installed they use its icons.",
	"guide-gatherer": "<strong>Gatherer's Hut</strong><br>The gatherer forages near the hut.<br><br><strong>Main</strong>: rename the hut, choose who works here, and order upgrades.<br><strong>Work area</strong>: how far out the gatherer goes, and whether a guard goes along.<br><strong>Markers</strong>: what the gatherer marks, and a button to remove its markers.<br><br>The gatherer picks ripe berries and fruit, mushrooms that are safe to eat, and loose stones, flints and sticks. It leaves stones in and right next to buildings. What it gathers goes to the hut, and couriers take it to the warehouse. Markers show on the Colony markers layer of the world map.",
