	"workstatus-needs-tool-spear": "needs a spear or other weapon (put one in the hut storage or the warehouse)",
	"job-hunter": "Hunter",
	"block-hut-hunter": "Hunter's Hut",
	"building-hunter": "Hunter's Hut",
	"hut-placed-hunter": "{0} placed. Give a settler the Hunter job. The hunter hunts animals near the hut and brings back meat and hides.",
	"hint-hunter": "The hunter hunts animals up to {0} blocks from the hut with a spear or other weapon. With a knife it skins them and brings the meat and hides here. It leaves monsters, penned animals and babies alone.",
	"guide-hunter": "<strong>Hunter's Hut</strong><br>The hunter hunts animals near the hut.<br><br><strong>Main</strong>: rename the hut, choose who works here, and order upgrades.<br><strong>Work area</strong>: how far out the hunter goes, and whether a guard goes along.<br><strong>Allowed to collect</strong>: which animals it hunts.<br><br>Give it a spear (any weapon works) and a knife. It skins its kills and brings what they give to the hut. Couriers take it to the warehouse. Without a knife it leaves its kills, and settlers without a job skin them.",
	"workarea-range-hint-hunter": "The hunter hunts in this range.",
