	"guide-mint": "<strong>Royal Mint</strong><br>The minter strikes the colony's coins.<br><br><strong>Main</strong>: rename the hut, choose who works here, and order upgrades.<br><strong>Crafting recipes</strong>: how many coins to keep. A new Mint keeps 100.<br><br>One copper ingot makes 10 coins. The minter needs a hammer. Coins in the Mint, the Town Hall's chests and the warehouse are the treasury. On the first day of each month the bailiff collects taxes into it and pays wages out of it (Town Hall, Bailiff tab).",
