	"hint-healer": "The healer makes bandages (Crafting recipes tab) and treats settlers who are in bed recovering. Settlers take a bandage from here to carry.",
	"guide-healer": "<strong>Healer's Hut</strong><br>The healer makes bandages and looks after hurt settlers.<br><br><strong>Main</strong>: rename the hut, choose who works here, and order upgrades.<br><strong>Crafting recipes</strong>: the bandages and poultices to keep. A new hut keeps 4 of each bandage.<br><br>Badly hurt settlers go home to bed to recover. The healer takes a bandage, walks to their bed and treats them, which heals more than a bandage they use on themselves. Settlers take one bandage or poultice each from here or the warehouse to carry, and use it when hurt. With none about, they make a horsetail poultice. The Gatherer picks horsetail.",
